Use in your Charge phase. Choose an enemy unit that is within Engagement Range of any SPACE WOLVES units in your army. For the rest of the turn:
• when a SPACE WOLVES BEAST or SPACE WOLVES CAVALRY unit of yours declares a charge targeting the chosen unit, roll one extra D6 and discard one of the dice;
• when one of your SPACE WOLVES CAVALRY models attacks the chosen unit with its crushing teeth and claws, or one of your SPACE WOLVES BEAST models attacks it with its teeth and claws, you can re-roll the wound roll.

