Malediction, warp charge 6: if manifested, pick one enemy unit within 18" of this psyker. Until your next Psychic phase starts:
• that unit can't fire Overwatch unless it is wholly on or within a terrain feature;
• in the Fight phase, it isn't eligible to fight until all eligible SPACE WOLVES units from your army have fought.
